      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "austin62jake",
        "email": "340374338+austin62jake@users.noreply.github.com",
        "date": "2026-11-08T15:24:24Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(app): STEP import reads the file's length unit\n\nThe importer read every STEP coordinate as millimetres, so a part saved\nin metres imported 1000x too small and one in inches 25.4x (#306). It\nnow resolves the representation contexts' LENGTH_UNIT (SI prefix, or a\nconversion-based unit through its measure) and scales the tessellated\nvertices to millimetres; an unreadable or contradictory unit refuses by\nname, and a file with none keeps millimetres.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
