      "message": "test(app): the STEP unit tests' fixture carries a full Part 21 header\n\nruststep's tokenizer refuses an empty HEADER section, so the four unit\ntests failed before reaching the reader. They now build the header the\nway exporters write it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
